OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm forever grateful for my
OL,4,Agirl's donated heart'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of Organ Donation Week, two
OL,7,Fmothers whose children were involved in
OL,8,Ftransplants share their stories from
OL,9,Feither side of the experience.
OL,11,FSeven-year-old Evie is thriving.
OL,13,FShe is doing well at school, enjoys
OL,14,Fplaying with friends and is keen to
OL,15,Fgive everything a go, her mother Chloe
OL,16,FGreen says.
OL,18,FBut for her daughter to be doing so
OL,19,Fwell today, another family had to go
OL,20,Fthrough the unimaginable pain of losing
OL,21,Ftheir child.
